  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* fix(list): size the daily table to the terminal height by @vizcay in https://github.com/kriuchkov/tock/pull/108\r\n* feat(report): support project summary in JSON output by @vizcay in https://github.com/kriuchkov/tock/pull/106\r\n* feat(report): add --week, --month, --quarter, --year date filters by @vizcay in https://github.com/kriuchkov/tock/pull/107\r\n* feat(list): delete the selected activity from the daily view by @vizcay in https://github.com/kriuchkov/tock/pull/109\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @vizcay made their first contribution in https://github.com/kriuchkov/tock/pull/108\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kriuchkov/tock/compare/v2.0.6...v2.0.7",
